**G3** — stepStorm sets t.b.damaged; plan() zeroes mult if damaged; stepRepairs deducts S.res.parts (repairCost) and clears damaged, restoring output next production step. Score 4.

**G4** — buyPrice/sellPrice = BASE_PRICE*drift*scarcity(S,r), scarcity reads S.res[r]/caps(S)[r]; drift random-walks each turn in stepMarket. Score 4.

